The helper is assumed to be part of the `functions` namespace you exposed, so you’ll call it as `functions.NodeIdConverter_format(...)`.

```java
import java.util.logging.LogRecord;   // or whatever LogEvent type you’re using
import java.lang.StringBuilder;

// ------------------------------------------------------------------
